pve-tools (1.9.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New tools:
    - pve-rolling-upgrade 1.0.0 - rolling, health-gated PVE 8->9 node
      upgrade: live-migrate guests off (HA-aware), dist-upgrade
      bookworm->trixie, pin NIC names, reboot, and gate on Ceph
      active+clean / quorum / EVPN before moving on. Hard-stops on any
      failed gate.
    - pve-ceph-upgrade 1.0.0 - online Ceph major-release migration
      (e.g. squid->tentacle): stage packages, then restart
      mon->mgr->osd->mds gating on health, then require-osd-release.
  * pve-import-cloud-images 1.4.0: version-aware, migration-safe CPU
    baseline selection.
  * pve-sdn-healthcheck: detect and opt-in fix for a stale zebra ZAPI
    socket that causes L3-VNI black-holes.
  * Bundled tool versions: pve-import-cloud-images 1.4.0,
    pve-vmnic-fix 1.0.0, pve-create-tshoot-image 1.3.0,
    pve-sdn-healthcheck 1.0.0, pve-rolling-upgrade 1.0.0,
    pve-ceph-upgrade 1.0.0.

